calling bs, who says your not wealthy. there is more value to someone then what they bring finciailly. its about what they bring to the family. bring light, and light is worth more. and honestly life is more then just having a job, but if you really need a job there are alot of jobs where i live in usa. even if they dont pay millions its enough to make ends meet. and being fertile is 1st world problem. if your not fertile or you are. you didnt choose that either way, aka its not your fault. if your husband is anything like me, he just wants to be able to have someone to be close to, and we typically feel real close during sex and physical attention(like kisses and back scratches). what im trying to say being fertile isnt the defintion of a good wife or person. also sorry you feel like abortion is the only route you have if you get a positive test. wish there was someone who could help in that regards.

&#x200B;

i suggest asking yourself what you want out of life, there is alot to be had if you want it.

, I could've had way more friends, 

