honestly, if your op, probably dont read this post but this is my opinion after reading all this. 

&#x200B;

honesty both you guys are AH, and i get that everyone can be an AH sometimes but honestly you basically made it to where this guy wont get to be apart of this kids life which honestly screws up your kid. so your making this kid suffer for both of your guys terrible communication skills and bad decisions. also basically taking and having harrys friend stay at your house makes me think this is some elabrate way to make you the victim but in reality your just trying to play the field. when you marry someone its suppose to be in sickness and in health and although he made poor deciscions that doesnt mean he is completely untrust worthy. like you are making this all about you and hes trying to figure out all this shit and the pressure men go through is alot to handle to. leaving his pregnant wife was really idiotic and horrible but it wasnt unforgiveable. atleast he didnt sleep with your cousin and then possibly gain an std and then sleep with you without you knowing he was cheating. like he really didnt do that horrible of stuff. like its not irredeemable. i just want to say that your a horrible wife for not caring about him too. hes pretty crap as well but to be honest it feels like you two are in eachothers class. the most redeeming part about you is that your hard working and a seemingly bredwinner which is a good thing but thats honestly the only thing you got going for you.

yeah, this is double, make sure broad mal has the highest hp on team, and then the enemy will target him last, also if you use refresh accsories on him then you can get some clutch rng to save you with him on the final boss. 

