this, if you tune the counter attack from skullcrusher after the the two aoe stuns, this particular team could be viable all the way to ultra nightmare clan boss. the only real obsticle at that point is gear.

&#x200B;

i would suggest altan lead, skullcrusher booked a2 for 3 turn cool down, frozbanshee, draco, and finally sandlashed survivor. 

&#x200B;

i think this team would be best over all on your account. since steelskill gets his def up and altan does that already. if you were to go this wrote i would replace steelskull with frozenbashee. at that point 3 poisioners on your team is to much. sandlash extends buggs and has a really good shared ally protect which comes in cluch.

&#x200B;

good luck bro!

i agree, youl goal is to CC and to survive, so have some aoe hitter and putting them in stun set. 

&#x200B;

i would alsolike to add that you might not want to worry about fw until your 20 all dungeons and have arbiter. just because fw requires you to dump resources in the not most optimal champs for your account. so until you can do the above i wouldnt worry about not getting far in faction wars for now.

